msgid "Remove settings remembered for modems that are no longer connected (AT port, interface, SIM slot types). A stale entry can hide a working modem from Internet priority if both claim the same interface name."
msgstr "移除為已斷開連接的數據機保存的設置（AT 埠、接口、SIM 卡槽類型）。如果過期條目與正在工作的數據機佔用同一接口名，可能會把它從網際網路優先級中隱藏。"

msgid "Forget disconnected modems"
msgstr "忘記已斷開的數據機"

msgid "Removing…"
msgstr "正在移除…"

msgid "Forgotten modems: %d"
msgstr "已忘記的數據機：%d"

msgid "Nothing to forget: every remembered modem is connected"
msgstr "無可忘記項：所有已記錄的數據機均已連接"

msgid "Failed to forget disconnected modems"
msgstr "忘記已斷開的數據機失敗"

msgid "Hide from ModemManager"
msgstr "對 ModemManager 隱藏"

msgid "ModemManager and a kernel protocol (QMI/MBIM) cannot share one modem: MM grabs the control channel and the interface gets no IP. Enabled by default for such protocols. Turn it off to hand the modem to ModemManager (its band/mode control is richer on some modems) - then use the ModemManager protocol for it."
msgstr "ModemManager 與內核協議（QMI/MBIM）無法共用同一個數據機：MM 會佔用控制通道，導致接口無法獲取 IP。對此類協議默認啟用。關閉後可將數據機交給 ModemManager（在部分數據機上其頻段/網絡模式控制更豐富）——此時請為其使用 ModemManager 協議。"

msgid "Diagnostic report"
msgstr "診斷報告"

msgid "Collects settings, modem ports, AT command output, ModemManager and eSIM state, and system logs into one text file and downloads it. Attach it to a bug report. The file contains modem and SIM identifiers (IMEI, IMSI, ICCID, EID) and the operator name; it does not contain passwords or Wi-Fi keys."
msgstr "收集設置、數據機埠、AT 命令輸出、ModemManager 和 eSIM 狀態以及系統日誌，打包為一個文本文件並下載。可將其附在問題報告中。文件包含數據機和 SIM 標識（IMEI、IMSI、ICCID、EID）及運營商名稱；不包含密碼或 Wi-Fi 密鑰。"

msgid "Collect logs"
msgstr "收集日誌"

msgid "Collecting logs…"
msgstr "正在收集日誌…"

msgid "Collecting logs failed"
msgstr "日誌收集失敗"

msgid "Timed out"
msgstr "已超時"

msgid "The report has been downloaded. Attach it to your bug report."
msgstr "報告已下載。請將其附在問題報告中。"

msgid "Interface “%s” was created for a different modem"
msgstr "接口「%s」是為另一個數據機創建的"

msgid "It is bound to this modem only because the kernel reused the device node, so its settings (APN in particular) may belong to the previous modem and SIM. Create the interface anew below - the APN is filled from the operator detected right now."
msgstr "它與此數據機綁定只是因為內核復用了設備節點，其設置（尤其是 APN）可能屬於之前的數據機和 SIM 卡。請在下方重新創建接口——APN 將按當前檢測到的運營商自動填寫。"

msgid "Loading messages…"
msgstr "正在加載簡訊…"

msgid "Antenna ports"
msgstr "天線埠"

msgid "Antenna port"
msgstr "天線埠"

msgid "State"
msgstr "狀態"

msgid "Port %d"
msgstr "埠 %d"

msgid "antenna not connected"
msgstr "天線未連接"

msgid "antenna: weak signal"
msgstr "天線：信號弱"

msgid "antenna: normal"
msgstr "天線：正常"

msgid "Applying 3G bands..."
msgstr "正在應用 3G 頻段..."

msgid "3G bands set: %s"
msgstr "3G 頻段已設置：%s"

msgid "Failed to set 3G bands"
msgstr "3G 頻段設置失敗"

msgid "Power restart"
msgstr "斷電重啟"

msgid "Cuts power to the modem slot for a few seconds - as if you unplugged it. The modem comes back in ~1 min. Use when a full restart did not help."
msgstr "切斷數據機插槽供電幾秒鐘——相當於將其拔出。約 1 分鐘後數據機會重新出現。在完整重啟無效時使用。"

msgid "“Hide from ModemManager” has been turned off: the ModemManager protocol needs MM to manage this modem"
msgstr "「對 ModemManager 隱藏」已關閉：ModemManager 協議需要 MM 來管理此數據機"

msgid "antenna: poor signal"
msgstr "天線：信號差"

msgid "enabled"
msgstr "已啟用"

msgid "disabled"
msgstr "已禁用"

msgid "Profile %s. Rebooting the modem to apply it - this takes up to a minute, please wait..."
msgstr "配置文件%s。正在重啟數據機以使其生效——最多需要一分鐘，請稍候..."

msgid "Profile added. Rebooting the modem to apply it - this takes up to a minute, please wait..."
msgstr "配置文件已添加。正在重啟數據機以使其生效——最多需要一分鐘，請稍候..."

msgid "eSIM profile added and applied"
msgstr "eSIM 配置文件已添加並生效"

msgid "Checking internet access..."
msgstr "正在檢查網際網路連接..."

msgid "No internet access. The router must be online to download an eSIM profile from the operator."
msgstr "無網際網路連接。路由器必須聯網才能從運營商下載 eSIM 配置文件。"

msgid "The operator server did not respond to a test request, but the internet is up. Trying to download anyway..."
msgstr "運營商伺服器未響應測試請求，但網際網路正常。仍嘗試下載..."

msgid "Changing bands briefly drops the connection: the IP disappears for ~15–20 seconds and comes back automatically. This is normal for this modem."
msgstr "更改頻段會短暫中斷連接：IP 會消失約 15–20 秒後自動恢復。這對此數據機屬正常現象。"

msgid "Updating the profile list..."
msgstr "正在更新配置文件列表..."

msgid "Could not refresh the list automatically. Press Refresh in a few seconds."
msgstr "無法自動刷新列表。請幾秒後點擊「刷新」。"

msgid "Speed test"
msgstr "測速"

msgid "Testing speed…"
msgstr "正在測速…"

msgid "Mbps"
msgstr "Mbps"

msgid "Test failed"
msgstr "測試失敗"

msgid "Measure the real download speed over the modem - a quick way to see whether carrier aggregation is actually working"
msgstr "通過數據機測量實際下載速度——快速檢驗載波聚合是否真正生效"

msgid "Measure the real download/upload speed over the modem - a quick way to see whether carrier aggregation is actually working"
msgstr "通過數據機測量實際下載/上傳速度——快速檢驗載波聚合是否真正生效"

msgid "Speed test: download source"
msgstr "測速：下載源"

msgid "Large-file URL for the download test, fetched over the modem. Pick a preset or enter your own. The default uses ~16 MB per run."
msgstr "用於下載測試的大文件 URL，通過數據機獲取。可選預設或自行填寫。默認每次測試約消耗 16 MB 流量。"

msgid "Speed test: upload endpoint"
msgstr "測速：上傳端點"

msgid "Endpoint that accepts and discards a POST body, for the upload test. In Russia the default (Cloudflare) is often unreachable over cellular - set a reachable one or leave upload unused."
msgstr "用於上傳測試的端點，需接收並丟棄 POST 請求體。在俄羅斯，默認端點（Cloudflare）經蜂窩網絡往往不可達——請設置一個可達的端點，或不使用上傳測試。"

msgid "Public IP service"
msgstr "公網 IP 服務"

msgid "Service that returns your public IP, checked over the modem. Pick a preset or enter your own; if it fails, the modem WAN IP is shown instead."
msgstr "返回公網 IP 的服務，通過數據機查詢。可選預設或自行填寫；失敗時改為顯示數據機 WAN IP。"

msgid "Download source"
msgstr "下載源"

msgid "Large-file URL for the download test. Pick a preset or enter your own. The default uses ~16 MB per run."
msgstr "用於下載測試的大文件 URL。可選預設或自行填寫。默認每次測試約消耗 16 MB 流量。"

msgid "Upload endpoint"
msgstr "上傳端點"

msgid "Service that returns your public IP. Pick a preset or enter your own; if it fails, the active uplink WAN IP is shown instead."
msgstr "返回公網 IP 的服務。可選預設或自行填寫；失敗時改為顯示當前上聯的 WAN IP。"

msgid "Open Modem Settings"
msgstr "打開數據機設置"

msgid "The modem is restarting…"
msgstr "數據機正在重啟…"

msgid "The modem is restarting after the SIM switch…"
msgstr "切換 SIM 後數據機正在重啟…"

msgid "Download transport (ES9+)"
msgstr "下載傳輸方式（ES9+）"

msgid "Auto (recommended)"
msgstr "自動（推薦）"

msgid "wget / OpenSSL bridge"
msgstr "wget / OpenSSL 橋接"

msgid "lpac built-in curl"
msgstr "lpac 內置 curl"

msgid "Download transport saved"
msgstr "下載傳輸方式已保存"

msgid "Country lookup"
msgstr "國家查詢"

msgid "Used only when the service above returns an IP but no country: the flag is then resolved by a second request. Use {ip} as the address placeholder."
msgstr "僅當上面的服務只返回 IP 而無國家信息時使用：此時通過第二次請求解析國旗。用 {ip} 作為地址佔位符。"

msgid "Service that returns your public IP. The default (ip-api.com) also returns the country, shown as a flag next to the IP. Pick a preset or enter your own; if it fails, a backup service is queried, and only then the local uplink address is shown (without a flag)."
msgstr "返回公網 IP 的服務。默認（ip-api.com）同時返回國家，以國旗形式顯示在 IP 旁。可選預設或自行填寫；失敗時先查詢備用服務，仍失敗才顯示本地上聯地址（不帶國旗）。"

msgid "Profile added. The modem is restarting to apply it - up to a minute…"
msgstr "配置文件已添加。數據機正在重啟以使其生效——最多一分鐘…"

msgid "Profile %s. The modem is restarting to apply it - up to a minute…"
msgstr "配置文件%s。數據機正在重啟以使其生效——最多一分鐘…"

msgid "Save log"
msgstr "保存日誌"

msgid "Reading the eUICC"
msgstr "正在讀取 eUICC"

msgid "Contacting the operator server"
msgstr "正在連接運營商伺服器"

msgid "Verifying the server"
msgstr "正在驗證伺服器"

msgid "Authenticating the card"
msgstr "正在認證卡片"

msgid "Receiving profile details"
msgstr "正在接收配置文件信息"

msgid "Preparing the download"
msgstr "正在準備下載"

msgid "Downloading the profile"
msgstr "正在下載配置文件"

msgid "Installing onto the card"
msgstr "正在安裝到卡上"

msgid "Closing the session"
msgstr "正在關閉會話"

msgid "Closing the server session"
msgstr "正在關閉伺服器會話"

msgid "Retrying"
msgstr "正在重試"

msgid "Lock state unknown - this modem does not report it"
msgstr "鎖定狀態未知——此數據機不報告該信息"

msgid "%s address of this router: %s"
msgstr "本路由器的 %s 地址：%s"

msgid "Could not reach the operator server: %s"
msgstr "無法連接運營商伺服器：%s"

msgid "The modem control channel is busy with the active connection, so the eSIM chip cannot be read right now. Disconnect the modem interface (or switch to another SIM) to manage profiles."
msgstr "數據機控制通道正被當前連接佔用，暫時無法讀取 eSIM 晶片。請斷開數據機接口（或切換到另一張 SIM）後再管理配置文件。"

msgid "The modem control channel is busy with the active connection, so the profile list cannot be read right now. Disconnect the modem interface (or switch to another SIM) to manage profiles."
msgstr "數據機控制通道正被當前連接佔用，暫時無法讀取配置文件列表。請斷開數據機接口（或切換到另一張 SIM）後再管理配置文件。"

msgid "Reading the eUICC, about %ds left"
msgstr "正在讀取 eUICC，剩餘約 %d 秒"

msgid "Taking longer than usual (%ds)"
msgstr "耗時比平常長（%d 秒）"

msgid "This profile is already installed on the eSIM — look for it in the list below."
msgstr "此配置文件已安裝在 eSIM 上——請在下方列表中查找。"

msgid "Not enough memory on the eSIM chip for this profile. Delete an unused profile and try again."
msgstr "eSIM 晶片存儲空間不足，無法安裝此配置文件。請刪除不用的配置文件後重試。"

msgid "The eSIM chip did not confirm the installation. This modem loses long commands from time to time, so a repeat usually helps. Check the profile list first — the profile may already be installed."
msgstr "eSIM 晶片未確認安裝。此數據機偶爾會丟失長命令，重試通常有效。請先檢查配置文件列表——配置文件可能已經安裝。"

msgid "Attempt %s of %s"
msgstr "第 %s 次嘗試，共 %s 次"

msgid "Roaming"
msgstr "漫遊"

msgid "Online"
msgstr "在線"

msgid "Cell lock"
msgstr "鎖小區"

msgid "Not locked"
msgstr "未鎖定"

msgid "Locked to cell: EARFCN %s, PCI %s"
msgstr "已鎖定小區：EARFCN %s，PCI %s"

msgid "Locked to frequency: EARFCN %s"
msgstr "已鎖定頻點：EARFCN %s"

msgid "Lock to current cell"
msgstr "鎖定當前小區"

msgid "Unlock"
msgstr "解鎖"

msgid "Serving cell is unknown yet"
msgstr "尚未獲知服務小區"

msgid "Locking to the current cell - the modem re-registers..."
msgstr "正在鎖定當前小區——數據機重新註冊中..."

msgid "Removing the lock - the modem restarts, connection drops for a while..."
msgstr "正在解除鎖定——數據機重啟，連接會中斷片刻..."

msgid "Multipart messages found - merging enabled automatically. You can turn it off in SMS settings."
msgstr "檢測到長簡訊分段——已自動啟用合併。可在簡訊設置中關閉。"

msgid "Serving cell is unknown yet - try again in a few seconds"
msgstr "尚未獲知服務小區——請幾秒後重試"

msgid "Locking to cell EARFCN %s, PCI %s - the modem re-registers..."
msgstr "正在鎖定小區 EARFCN %s、PCI %s——數據機重新註冊中..."

msgid "eNB ID"
msgstr "eNB ID"

msgid "(base station)"
msgstr "（基站）"

msgid "Path loss"
msgstr "路徑損耗"

msgid "(signal attenuation)"
msgstr "（信號衰減）"

