msgstr "%d 秒"

msgid "%d min"
msgstr "%d 分鐘"

msgid "Select all"
msgstr "全選"

msgid "selected: %d"
msgstr "已選：%d"

msgid "Memory: %s/%s"
msgstr "存儲：%s/%s"

msgid "USSD does not work on this modem: it is a data-only module without SS support in the firmware. Verified on real hardware - the modem does not answer USSD requests at all."
msgstr "此數據機不支持 USSD：它是純數據模塊，固件不支持 SS 業務。已在實機驗證——數據機對 USSD 請求完全不響應。"

msgid "No messages"
msgstr "無簡訊"

msgid "Signal level indicator"
msgstr "信號強度指示"

msgid "Show signal level on the case LEDs"
msgstr "在機身 LED 上顯示信號強度"

msgid "Three LEDs show the signal level. Reads the same data as this page - the modem is not polled separately."
msgstr "三個 LED 顯示信號強度。讀取與本頁相同的數據——不會單獨輪詢數據機。"

msgid "Signal LEDs enabled"
msgstr "信號 LED 已啟用"

msgid "Signal LEDs disabled"
msgstr "信號 LED 已禁用"

msgid "The network registered this SIM for SMS only, so USSD is unavailable right now: it is a voice-domain service. The modem itself supports USSD - requests will simply stay unanswered until the registration changes."
msgstr "網絡僅將此 SIM 註冊為簡訊業務，因此 USSD 目前不可用：它是語音域業務。數據機本身支持 USSD——在註冊狀態改變前，請求將一直得不到應答。"

msgid "Show the signal level on the three case LEDs. Reads the same snapshot as the pages - the modem is not polled separately."
msgstr "在機身三個 LED 上顯示信號強度。讀取與頁面相同的快照——不會單獨輪詢數據機。"

msgid "LED metric"
msgstr "LED 指標"

msgid "Which value the LEDs show. Thresholds match the colours used on the Network page, so three LEDs and a green value mean the same thing."
msgstr "LED 顯示哪個數值。閾值與「網絡」頁面所用顏色一致，因此三個 LED 全亮與綠色數值含義相同。"

msgid "RSRP (signal level, default)"
msgstr "RSRP（信號強度，默認）"

msgid "RSRQ (signal quality)"
msgstr "RSRQ（信號質量）"

msgid "SINR (signal to noise)"
msgstr "SINR（信噪比）"

msgid "Overall level (percent)"
msgstr "百分比（數據機標度）"

msgid "Show on the case LEDs"
msgstr "在機身 LED 上顯示"

msgid "Reads the same snapshot as the pages - the modem is not polled separately. Applies immediately, no Save needed."
msgstr "讀取與頁面相同的快照——不會單獨輪詢數據機。立即生效，無需保存。"

msgid "Thresholds match the colours used on the Network page, so three LEDs and a green value mean the same thing"
msgstr "閾值與「網絡」頁面所用顏色一致，因此三個 LED 全亮與綠色數值含義相同"

msgid "A different modem is now in this USB port"
msgstr "此 USB 埠現在接入的是另一個數據機"

msgid "Its IMEI does not match the one seen here before - the modems were probably swapped. The settings of this slot (the interface and its APN in particular) belong to the previous modem and its SIM. Check them below and create the interface anew if needed."
msgstr "其 IMEI 與此前在此看到的不一致——數據機可能被調換了。該插槽的設置（尤其是接口及其 APN）屬於之前的數據機及其 SIM 卡。請在下方檢查，必要時重新創建接口。"

msgid "Saved modem profiles"
msgstr "已保存的數據機配置"

msgid "No modems seen yet"
msgstr "尚未發現任何數據機"

msgid "Device ID"
msgstr "設備 ID"

msgid "IMEI unknown"
msgstr "IMEI 未知"

msgid "active"
msgstr "當前使用"

msgid "connected"
msgstr "已連接"

msgid "not connected"
msgstr "未連接"

msgid "no interface"
msgstr "無接口"

