msgstr "此數據機為只讀：鎖定只能通過 AT 命令解除"

msgid "default APN"
msgstr "默認 APN"

msgid "default"
msgstr "默認"

msgid "The app saves the settings of every modem you connect. Plug a known modem back in and it is detected automatically and picks up its profile. Profiles that are no longer relevant are worth deleting — their network interfaces can cause confusion."
msgstr "本應用會保存所連接的每個數據機的設置。重新插入已知的數據機時會自動識別並套用其配置。不再需要的配置建議刪除——其網絡接口可能造成混亂。"

msgid "locked to cell %s/%s"
msgstr "已鎖定小區 %s/%s"

msgid "locked to frequency %s"
msgstr "已鎖定頻點 %s"

msgid "visible to ModemManager"
msgstr "對 ModemManager 可見"

msgid "hidden from ModemManager"
msgstr "對 ModemManager 隱藏"

msgid "ModemManager is running"
msgstr "ModemManager 正在運行"

msgid "ModemManager is stopped — no connected modem needs it"
msgstr "ModemManager 已停止——沒有已連接的數據機需要它"

msgid "visible"
msgstr "可見"

msgid "hidden"
msgstr "隱藏"

msgid "the data interface did not come up — not enough power?"
msgstr "數據接口未能啟動——供電不足？"

msgid "AT ports (debug mode)"
msgstr "AT 埠（調試模式）"

msgid "Such a modem normally exposes only its web interface: no TAC, no band, no EARFCN, no USSD. In this mode it also shows serial ports and is driven like any other modem, keeping its network card and internet. The mode is reset when the modem reboots, so it is applied again every time the modem appears."
