msgstr "此配置文件需要確認碼，或輸入的確認碼有誤。"

msgid "A profile with this ICCID is already installed on the eSIM."
msgstr "eSIM 上已安裝此 ICCID 的配置文件。"

msgid "The operator could not verify this eSIM chip (eUICC verification failed)."
msgstr "運營商無法驗證此 eSIM 晶片（eUICC 驗證失敗）。"

msgid "The operator refused to release this profile."
msgstr "運營商拒絕發放此配置文件。"

msgid "Not enough free memory on the eSIM to install the profile. Delete an unused profile and try again."
msgstr "eSIM 上的可用存儲空間不足，無法安裝配置文件。請刪除未使用的配置文件後重試。"

