msgid "eSIM management needs the lpac package, which is not installed. Install the lpac build for your platform - see the app README."
msgstr "eSIM 管理需要 lpac 軟體包，但尚未安裝。請安裝適用於您平臺的 lpac 構建——參見應用 README。"

msgid "This modem is on the ModemManager protocol, where eSIM over AT commands is not available. Switch the modem interface to the fibocom / MBIM / QMI protocol to manage eSIM."
msgstr "此數據機使用 ModemManager 協議，該協議下無法通過 AT 命令管理 eSIM。請將數據機接口切換到 fibocom / MBIM / QMI 協議以管理 eSIM。"

msgid "No eSIM chip (eUICC) answered on this modem. If you are sure it has one, it may be in a USB composition this app does not talk to yet - please report your modem model and its USB ID (vid:pid) so we can add support."
msgstr "此數據機上沒有 eSIM 晶片（eUICC）響應。若您確定其配有 eSIM，可能是當前 USB 組合尚不受本應用支持——請反饋您的數據機型號及其 USB ID（vid:pid），以便我們添加支持。"

msgid "eUICC access (APDU)"
msgstr "eUICC 訪問（APDU）"

msgid "AT (serial - FM350 etc.)"
msgstr "AT（串口——FM350 等）"

msgid "QMI / libqmi (Qualcomm)"
msgstr "QMI / libqmi（Qualcomm）"

msgid "QMI / uqmi CLI"
msgstr "QMI / uqmi CLI"

msgid "AT bridge (sms_tool)"
msgstr "AT 橋接（sms_tool）"

msgid "eUICC access saved"
msgstr "eUICC 訪問方式已保存"

msgid "These are status reports the modem sends to your operator (SM-DP+) after a profile is enabled, disabled or deleted. They normally go out on their own. If some are stuck here (e.g. there was no internet at the time), the safe choice is Send — it is harmless and just confirms the change. Remove only discards a report without sending it. If unsure, you can leave them or press Send all."
msgstr "這些是配置文件在啟用、禁用或刪除後，數據機發送給運營商（SM-DP+）的狀態報告。通常會自動發出。若有報告滯留在此（例如當時沒有網絡連接），安全的做法是點「發送」——它無害，只是確認變更。「移除」則不發送、直接丟棄報告。不確定時可以保留，或點「全部發送」。"

msgid "Send all"
msgstr "全部發送"

msgid "Send all pending notifications to the operator, then clear them"
msgstr "將所有待發送通知發送給運營商，然後清除"

