msgstr "新"

msgid "USSD works over the circuit-switched channel. If the modem is registered in LTE only, switch it to 3G on the frequency-management page and repeat the request."
msgstr "USSD 通過電路交換信道工作。若數據機僅註冊在 LTE，請在頻率管理頁面將其切換到 3G 後重試請求。"

msgid "The modem is registered in %s now, and USSD runs over the circuit-switched channel. The request will therefore switch the modem to 3G and switch it back on its own - the connection drops for about twenty seconds."
msgstr "數據機當前註冊在 %s，而 USSD 通過電路交換信道工作。因此請求會自動將數據機切換到 3G 並在完成後切回——連接會中斷約二十秒。"

msgid "Switching the modem to 3G - USSD needs the circuit-switched channel"
msgstr "正在將數據機切換到 3G——USSD 需要電路交換信道"

msgid "Sending the request"
msgstr "正在發送請求"

msgid "Restoring the previous network mode"
msgstr "正在恢復之前的網絡模式"

msgid "Could not switch the modem to 3G, so the request was not sent: USSD needs the circuit-switched channel."
msgstr "無法將數據機切換到 3G，因此請求未發送：USSD 需要電路交換信道。"

msgid "This modem does not answer USSD requests: its firmware has no SS support. Verified on real hardware."
msgstr "此數據機不響應 USSD 請求：其固件不支持 SS。已在真實硬體上驗證。"

msgid "No reply. The request went to a modem that is not the active one, so it was not switched to 3G - and USSD needs the circuit-switched channel. Select this modem and repeat."
msgstr "無回復。請求發送到了非當前活動的數據機，因此未切換到 3G——而 USSD 需要電路交換信道。請選擇此數據機後重試。"

msgid "Switch the modem to 3G for USSD"
msgstr "為 USSD 將數據機切換到 3G"

msgid "USSD runs over the circuit-switched channel, which LTE does not have. Some modems handle this themselves; others answer nothing until the modem is actually in 3G. With this option the request switches the modem to 3G and switches it back - about twenty seconds without a connection. It is enabled automatically for modems already known to need it."
msgstr "USSD 通過電路交換信道工作，而 LTE 沒有該信道。有些數據機會自行處理；有些則在真正進入 3G 前不作任何應答。啟用此選項後，請求會將數據機切換到 3G 並在完成後切回——約二十秒無連接。對已知需要此操作的數據機會自動啟用。"

msgid "The modem is registered in %s now, and USSD runs over the circuit-switched channel. The request will therefore switch the modem to 3G and switch it back - the connection drops for about twenty seconds."
msgstr "數據機當前註冊在 %s，而 USSD 通過電路交換信道工作。因此請求會將數據機切換到 3G 並在完成後切回——連接會中斷約二十秒。"

msgid "Data has not been updated for %d s (shown from the last snapshot)"
msgstr "數據已有 %d 秒未更新（顯示的是最後一次快照）"

msgid "Data has not been updated for %d min (shown from the last snapshot)"
msgstr "數據已有 %d 分鐘未更新（顯示的是最後一次快照）"

msgid "Internet is working (%s ms)"
msgstr "網際網路正常（%s ms）"

msgid "No internet on this link"
msgstr "此鏈路無網際網路連接"

msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "正在檢查…"

msgid "Internet watchdog settings"
msgstr "網際網路看門狗設置"

msgid "Internet watchdog"
msgstr "網際網路看門狗"

msgid "Pings each uplink through its own device. A link is marked down after several consecutive failures and up again after several successes, so single lost packets do not flip the state. Health lamps are shown on the cards; traffic switching is optional and enabled below."
msgstr "通過各自的設備對每條上行鏈路執行 ping。鏈路在連續多次失敗後標記為斷開，連續多次成功後恢復為正常，因此個別丟包不會改變狀態。卡片上顯示健康指示燈；流量切換為可選項，可在下方啟用。"

msgid "Enable watching"
msgstr "啟用監視"

msgid "Check interval, s"
msgstr "檢查間隔（秒）"

msgid "Ping targets (comma-separated)"
msgstr "Ping 目標（逗號分隔）"

msgid "Failures before down"
msgstr "判定斷開的失敗次數"

msgid "Successes before up"
msgstr "判定恢復的成功次數"

msgid "Switch traffic to a backup link when one goes down"
msgstr "鏈路斷開時將流量切換到備用鏈路"

msgid "A link that has an address but no internet will not give the traffic up on its own - the watchdog moves the route past it, and brings it back when the link recovers. Route metrics in the settings stay untouched. On by default."
msgstr "有地址但無網際網路的鏈路不會自行讓出流量——看門狗會將路由繞過它，並在鏈路恢復後切回。設置中的路由躍點數保持不變。默認開啟。"

msgid "Traffic goes through %s, and there is no internet on it. Automatic switching is off - the watchdog sees the failure and does nothing."
msgstr "流量正經過 %s，而該鏈路無網際網路。自動切換已關閉——看門狗檢測到故障但不會採取行動。"

msgid "Turn switching on"
msgstr "開啟切換"

msgid "Heal a modem while its link is down"
msgstr "鏈路斷開時修復數據機"

msgid "Steps are tried from mild to strong, at most once per 5 minutes, 6 attempts total; the ladder resets when the link recovers."
msgstr "按從輕到重的步驟依次嘗試，每 5 分鐘最多一次，共 6 次；鏈路恢復後階梯重置。"

